  speakerName: "PH\xD3 L\xDD"
  title: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng s\u1ED1ng y\xEAn \u1ED5n tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i"
  content: "L\xE0ng d\u1EA7n c\xF3 l\u1EA1i ti\u1EBFng c\u01B0\u1EDDi. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    ta kh\xF4ng c\xF2n nh\xECn c\u1EADu ta nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t k\u1EBB l\u1EA1 n\u1EEFa
    \u2014 c\u1EADu ta \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a n\u01A1i
    n\xE0y, m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 d\u1EF1a m\xE0 ai c\u0169ng t\xECm \u0111\u1EBFn."
  portrait: {fileID: 1871985265, guid: 05340f7438bce374e96af080bb0729ad, type: 3}
